="02:22.390">ever</span><span begin="02:22.390" end="02:22.390">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.390" end="02:26.530"><span begin="02:22.390" end="02:22.720">It's </span><span begin="02:22.720" end="02:22.870">the </span><span begin="02:22.870" end="02:23.800">best </span><span begin="02:23.800" end="02:24.820">day </span><span begin="02:24.820" end="02:26.530">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.530" end="02:29.920"><span begin="02:26.530" end="02:26.560">（</span><span begin="02:26.560" end="02:27.580">Best </span><span begin="02:27.580" end="02:29.410">day </span><span begin="02:29.410" end="02:29.920">ever</span><span begin="02:29.920" end="02:29.920">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.920" end="02:34.150"><span begin="02:29.920" end="02:30.220">It's </span><span begin="02:30.220" end="02:30.370">the </span><span begin="02:30.370" end="02:31.330">best </span><span begin="02:31.330" end="02:32.320">day </span><span begin="02:32.320" end="02:34.150">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.150" end="02:37.390"><span begin="02:34.150" end="02:34.150">（</span><span begin="02:34.150" end="02:35.140">Best </span><span begin="02:35.140" end="02:36.730">day </span><span begin="02:36.730" end="02:37.390">ever</span><span begin="02:37.390" end="02:37.390">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.390" end="02:41.530"><span begin="02:37.390" end="02:37.720">It's </span><span begin="02:37.720" end="02:37.870">the </span><span begin="02:37.870" end="02:38.830">best </span><span begin="02:38.830" end="02:39.820">day </span><span begin="02:39.820" end="02:41.530">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.530" end="02:49.120"><span begin="02:41.530" end="02:41.560">（</span><span begin="02:41.560" end="02:42.580">Best </span><span begin="02:42.580" end="02:44.290">day </span><span begin="02:44.290" end="02:45.460">ever</span><span begin="02:45.460" end="02:49.120">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.120" end="02:53.410"><span begin="02:49.120" end="02:50.170">Best </span><span begin="02:50.170" end="02:51.970">day </span><span begin="02:51.970" end="02:53.410">ever</span></p></div></body></tt>